{"id":"3db83908de2fd3e1","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-harmonic-map.md","title":"Harmonic Map","display":"df-harmonic-map — Harmonic Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-harmonic-map","aliases":["58-df-harmonic-map"],"display":"df-harmonic-map — Harmonic Map","depends_on":["[[58-df-riemannian-manifold]]","[[58-df-smooth-map]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-harmonic-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-harmonic-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-harmonic-map — Harmonic Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"04b9f5c6479b7ecd\" href=\"?note=04b9f5c6479b7ecd\" title=\"58-df-riemannian-manifold\">58-df-riemannian-manifold</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d87c5d842ade903d\" href=\"?note=d87c5d842ade903d\" title=\"58-df-smooth-map\">58-df-smooth-map</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,g,N,h,f\\in V\">\\(M,g,N,h,f\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)\">\\(\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(N,h)\">\\(\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(N,h)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"04b9f5c6479b7ecd\" href=\"?note=04b9f5c6479b7ecd\" title=\"58-df-riemannian-manifold\">58-df-riemannian-manifold</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(f,M,N)\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(f,M,N)\\)</span> (smooth-map predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d87c5d842ade903d\" href=\"?note=d87c5d842ade903d\" title=\"58-df-smooth-map\">58-df-smooth-map</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nabla^g,\\nabla^h\">\\(\\nabla^g,\\nabla^h\\)</span> (the metatheoretically unique Levi--Civita connections of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nabla^{f^*TN}\">\\(\\nabla^{f^*TN}\\)</span> (the induced connection on the pullback tangent bundle)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0_{f^*TN}\">\\(0_{f^*TN}\\)</span> (the zero section of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^*TN\">\\(f^*TN\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TensionField}_S(\\tau,f,M,g,N,h)\">\\(\\mathrm{TensionField}_S(\\tau,f,M,g,N,h)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HarmonicMap}_S(f,M,g,N,h)\">\\(\\operatorname{HarmonicMap}_S(f,M,g,N,h)\\)</span> (metatheoretic differential-geometric predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}harmonic\\text{-}map\\text{-}tension} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{TensionField}_S(\\tau,f,M,g,N,h)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)\\land\n\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(N,h)\\land\n\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(f,M,N)\\land\n\\tau=\\operatorname{tr}_g\\bigl(\\nabla^{f^*TN}df\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}harmonic\\text{-}map\\text{-}tension} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{TensionField}_S(\\tau,f,M,g,N,h)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)\\land\n\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(N,h)\\land\n\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(f,M,N)\\land\n\\tau=\\operatorname{tr}_g\\bigl(\\nabla^{f^*TN}df\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}harmonic\\text{-}map} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\operatorname{HarmonicMap}_S(f,M,g,N,h)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{TensionField}_S(\\tau,f,M,g,N,h)\\land\\tau=0_{f^*TN}\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}harmonic\\text{-}map} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\operatorname{HarmonicMap}_S(f,M,g,N,h)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{TensionField}_S(\\tau,f,M,g,N,h)\\land\\tau=0_{f^*TN}\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{g,h}(f)=0\">\\(\\tau_{g,h}(f)=0\\)</span> is the Euler--Lagrange equation for the map energy; being a critical point does not by itself imply local minimality.</li>\n<li>The pullback bundle and induced Levi--Civita connection are not constructed by the current set-level manifold atoms, so the turnstile explicitly records the metatheoretic boundary instead of treating <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nabla df\">\\(\\nabla df\\)</span> as an unbound object term.</li>\n<li>Eells–Sampson (1964): heat flow for harmonic maps.</li>\n<li>Regularity: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dim M = 2\">\\(\\dim M = 2\\)</span>: energy minimizing maps are continuous.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dim M \\geq 3\">\\(\\dim M \\geq 3\\)</span>: singularities may occur (countexamples by Rivière).</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-riemannian-manifold","status":"resolved","id":"04b9f5c6479b7ecd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-riemannian-manifold]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-smooth-map","status":"resolved","id":"d87c5d842ade903d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-smooth-map]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-riemannian-manifold","status":"resolved","id":"04b9f5c6479b7ecd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)$ and $\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(N,h)$ (see [[58-df-riemannian-manifold]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-smooth-map","status":"resolved","id":"d87c5d842ade903d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(f,M,N)$ (smooth-map predicate, see [[58-df-smooth-map]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,g,N,h,f\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(N,h)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(f,M,N)","display":false},{"tex":"\\nabla^g,\\nabla^h","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"h","display":false},{"tex":"\\nabla^{f^*TN}","display":false},{"tex":"0_{f^*TN}","display":false},{"tex":"f^*TN","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TensionField}_S(\\tau,f,M,g,N,h)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{HarmonicMap}_S(f,M,g,N,h)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}harmonic\\text{-}map\\text{-}tension} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{TensionField}_S(\\tau,f,M,g,N,h)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)\\land\n\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(N,h)\\land\n\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(f,M,N)\\land\n\\tau=\\operatorname{tr}_g\\bigl(\\nabla^{f^*TN}df\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}harmonic\\text{-}map} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\operatorname{HarmonicMap}_S(f,M,g,N,h)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{TensionField}_S(\\tau,f,M,g,N,h)\\land\\tau=0_{f^*TN}\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau_{g,h}(f)=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\nabla df","display":false},{"tex":"\\dim M = 2","display":false},{"tex":"\\dim M \\geq 3","display":false}],"bytes":2028,"backlinks":[{"id":"ad55d3b2dfeece56","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e06256d3696011c6","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-606","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-harmonic-map.md|58-df-harmonic-map]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["04b9f5c6479b7ecd","d87c5d842ade903d"]}